{"id":"excepto","lemma":"excepto","pos":"prep","rank":760,"glosses":["except"],"ipa":"/e(ɡ)ˈθebto/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-excepto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Haré cualquier cosa excepto eso.","en":"I will do anything but that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703614","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,{"g":"thing"},null,{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Nadie es perfecto, excepto yo.","en":"No one's perfect, except me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/694518","words":[null,null,null,null,{"g":"I"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"nobody's perfect"]]},{"text":"Todos se fueron excepto nosotros.","en":"Everyone went except us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735093","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},null,{"g":"we"}]},{"text":"Todos habían venido excepto tú.","en":"Everyone had come except you.","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},null,{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Podemos huir de todo, excepto de nuestra conciencia.","en":"We can run away from everything, except from our conscience.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693537","words":[{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to flee, to run away"},null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"awareness"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"all kinds of things"]]}]}